Codec: only the LPASS audio HW vote (block 4); /dev/console writes of sweetnull processes to the log.

all22: L14 acked, clocks 0x30c/0x30d given, block 4 vote given (handle 23), block 3
("LPASS_HW_MACRO") refused with status 1, so stage 1 stopped before any register. spes's DT
has only vote_lpass_audio_hw. And the PosterBoard/pkd jobs now pointed at /dev/console
(root change) wrote to the muted screen console: cnwrite copies the writes of the processes in
sweetnull into the persistent log as "|name| text".

--- a/bsd/dev/mem.c
